  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Electoral Reform in PNG (SERP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this investment, Australia will continue to work with the Papua New Guinea Electoral Commission (PNGEC) to strengthen electoral systems in Papua New Guinea and improve the integrity of elections.  The program will be delivered through partnerships between PNGEC and the Australian Electoral Commission (AEC); International Foundation for Electoral Systems (IFES); and other modalities.</narrative>
  </description>
